    {
      "article_number": 125,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "توزيع الأرباح على المساهمين",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "b51eb9a225ecc4b3fbacf1128c28d44478575d8ce9e109b598777c35b3f19efc",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "54abbe57daf81a0321d2f3a67c5192b63d4cde69a31e5b907c6f934150b1fa03",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "股东大会确定扣除储备金（如有）后应当向股东分配的净利润比例。\n股东依照股东大会就此作出的决议享有其利润份额；该决议载明应享日期和分配日期。在为应享确定之日终了时登记于股东名册的股份所有人，享有取得利润的权利。实施条例确定董事会执行股东大会关于向股东分配利润决议的最长期限。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "60040ff3369dbedb793be34c56396feeebc287190c4dd439ba42abc3e21af4a1",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 126,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "طرق زيادة رأس المال",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "b0395b6be6f02854c26c91fa4e934bd7f29248eae404bf741d2b533035dad704",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "728675bab7ced2f5bc7c65c9b504f7fdab010085d0ef8b3315f62798f4cf034a",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "资本以下列方式之一增加：\n（一）对价现金出资或实物出资发行新股份。\n（二）经相关债权人同意，对价公司所负确定金额且已到期的债务发行新股份。该发行应当以特别股东大会在征询一名或多名专家或经认可的评估师意见后所确定的价值进行；董事会应当就该等债务的来源和金额编制说明，由董事会成员签署并对其真实性负责，并就此附具公司审计师的报告。\n（三）按特别股东大会决定并入资本的储备金数额发行新股份。该等股份应当以与已发行的同一种类或类别股份相同的形式和条件发行，并按各股东所持原始股份的比例无偿分配给股东。\n（四）对价债务工具或融资凭证发行新股份。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "e786c653feb839dc6857f4bc56b81daecddb21da40ddc00b5044a254740027e8",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 127,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "زيادة رأس المال المصدر أو المصرح به",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "ba0928fda7ff41ae860baeb156a5c584b4bb47c82f3d59a0e5f031d42ee8677f",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "975a1f40dc9c674fd1a5bf7679be81be37f3c528603649b3f2f5349f725c48b9",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "特别股东大会可以决定增加公司的已发行资本或授权资本（如有），但以已发行资本已全额缴付为条件。已发行资本的未缴付部分系因对价将债务工具或融资凭证转换为股份而发行、且其转换所定期限尚未届满的，不以资本已全额缴付为条件。\n在任何情形下，特别股东大会在增加资本时，可以将所发行的股份或其一部分分配给公司或其任何子公司的员工。就公司为员工分配所发行的股份，股东不得行使优先认购权。主管机关可以制定向公司或其任何子公司员工分配股份的规则和程序。\n在任何情形下，增资股份的票面价值应当与同一种类或类别原始股份的票面价值相等。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "5488f15b60cc055f26bf18eb598513241500eccb82f09902500a27c6d04b1f73",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 128,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "أولوية الاكتتاب بالأسهم الجديدة",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "3aa525d73fe575fff12275748a3a789985cdd1a5f799a8c265f6959317314e6c",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "a154ea33fbe8a46e574c0b3ede65d96ae5a2810c33eb6ebcbe21c7d646f725f3",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "在特别股东大会作出批准增加已发行资本的决议时、或董事会作出在授权资本限额内批准增资的决议时持有股份的股东，就对价现金出资所发行的新股份享有优先认购权。应当以挂号信向其在股东名册所载地址发出通知，或通过现代技术手段，将其优先权（如有）、增资决议、认购的条件和方式及其起止日期通知该股东，并顾及其所持股份的种类和类别。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "a473d3da91acb1fbe21ad154100f2aefb1c1c162783968f57f189e9eb4cac679",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 129,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "وقف العمل بحق الأولوية",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "ea0d77c7711a6f4f79888c1f438cf02ce503bf53e7f6de79923ddef3e0f53b64",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "4bad88b6f9f53caeab8e6be2287ef72988e39369eaefa978d5890b645cc67161",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "公司章程有规定的，特别股东大会有权在其认为有利于公司利益的情形下，中止股东就对价现金出资的资本增加进行认购的优先权，或将该优先权授予非股东。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "f6d3d62a4403d856f4e65ae8c8051c684aeb6c0c6c26809e3ed93dd5a2b51e0f",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 130,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "بيع حق الأولوية أو التنازل عنه",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "85fdcd88315b714a2c1e5494d38f4c64465ecf2cbfd014445258512b95609489",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "06f1b25d79d0b4dcc0b7c63139de4d29a17ee3e774e47dd8bd2afc26bac3d686",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "股份公司的股东可以依照实施条例的规定，有偿或无偿出售或转让其优先认购权。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "f216e2a9b8c14fd091d7ad5e972a1f0df6e4550a509da2d126a591dfca9d3ae0",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 131,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "توزيع الأسهم الجديدة",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "b404f17f7af9a61370d07209d3271939c36b876bc55db682a3ce4ae8dacdb1f7",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "d71a9cdfc849cc0284e6a17c03713d3db6912a5d0157769e82ed396da72af5a9",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "新股份按请求认购的优先权持有人所持优先权占资本增加所产生优先权总额的比例向其分配，但其所得不得超过其所请求的新股份数，并顾及其所持股份的种类和类别；剩余的新股份，按请求超过其应得份额的优先权持有人所持优先权占资本增加所产生优先权总额的比例向其分配，但其所得不得超过其所请求的新股份数；仍有剩余的股份向第三人发售，但特别股东大会另有决定或资本市场法另有规定的除外。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "31b9fa22aa6ce8fefd27894cd4e1a468a4814ec7d47da2c685faae70009f3eba",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 134,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "إصدار قرار تخفيض رأس المال",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "97512a4a7aeb8a92affb3a4e598dcaed950794da1992f95fb7f836bd0cd9eb69",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "9a4ecca4cc527236eba05268ecf81ffc774d02b76bdf91b04768900e2505232c",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "特别股东大会可以在资本超过公司需要、或公司遭受亏损时，决定减少资本。仅在后一情形下，可以将资本减至低于本法第五十九条所定限额以下。减资决议只有在股东大会上宣读由董事会就减资理由、公司义务及减资对履行该等义务的影响所编制的说明后，方可作出；该说明应当附具公司审计师的报告。在股东大会决议以书面传阅方式作出的情形下，可以仅将上述说明提交股东。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "73e4cac1473c3d463a8dab30d656a0960d843a145d1885590e664315d0418180",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
      "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
      "source_status_before": "excluded_no_isolable_article_text",
      "remediation_action": "create_new_internal_chinese_translation_from_arabic",
      "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
    },
    {
      "article_number": 135,
      "bab": 4,
      "article_title_ar": "إجراءات تخفيض رأس المال",
      "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "5b0b4f10bb1d7e65996fdf5458e0c699d75e1bcedbe5029c25acd5ace43f862c",
      "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "216ab4ab9a635cbd24c4d554cadc25b409bed9c6f7d88640f0c1c6a4e3127c04",
      "remediated_chinese_text": "减资系因资本超过公司需要的，应当在为召开特别股东大会作出减资决议所确定的日期之前至少（四十五）日，通知债权人提出其对减资的异议（如有）；通知应当附具说明，载明减资前后的资本数额、会议召开的时间及减资生效的日期。任何债权人在上述期限内对减资提出异议并向公司提交其凭证的，公司应当在债务已到期时向其清偿债务，或在债务未到期时向其提供充分的清偿担保。已就减资通知公司其异议、而其已到期债务未获清偿、或其未到期债务未获充分清偿担保的债权人，可以在为召开特别股东大会作出减资决议所确定的日期之前，向主管司法机关提起请求；在此情形下，主管司法机关可以视情况命令清偿债务、提供充分担保，或延期召开特别股东大会会议。\n对于在本条第（1）款所定期限内提出请求的债权人，除非其已到期债务获得清偿、或其未到期债务获得充分的清偿担保，否则不得以减资对抗该债权人。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "dad59f3dc9501dfd7e31d6afb8a4540b4802e0065cf735fc7ae6e7453788282a",
      "internal_reference_only": true,
      "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
      "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
      "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
      "human_legal_review_status": "pending_human_legal_review",
